.TH TTREK 1 "November 2026" "ttrek" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ttrek \- manage Tcl toolchains and extensions in a project environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ttrek
.I subcommand
.RI [ argument ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ttrek
resolves package dependencies and builds packages in a project environment.
.SH HELP
.TP
.B ttrek help
Show general usage and list the available subcommands.
.TP
.BI "ttrek help " subcommand
Show help for a specific subcommand.
For example, run
.B ttrek help install
for installation options.
